                        <li>Undo/redo with a 32-snapshot bound per handle</li>
                        <li>Layer add, rename, visibility and lock</li>
                        <li>Inspection findings with layer and object locators</li>
                        <li>SVG and ASCII DXF export plus vector PDF output</li>
                        <li>ASCII DXF import for the declared subset</li>
                        <li>CLI and SDK on the same native handle store</li>
